# Client data. Never commit. See the hard rules in CLAUDE.md.
extracts/
**/extracts/
*.parquet
*.csv.gz
data/
workbooks/

# Internal Kicksaw calls. Filename pattern is the control: any transcript with
# an -internal- segment is Kicksaw-only and never reaches a client surface.
**/*-internal-*.md

# Call transcripts. Client calls live in the Notion Fred Hutch Transcripts
# database, the source of truth; the files here are local working copies.
# The whole folder stays out of git, including its index and template.
# Decided by Ben Bolding 2026-09-30, widened to the folder 2026-10-01.
discovery/transcripts/

# Local only: stays on Ben Bolding's machine and never reaches the GitHub
# remote. Decided by Ben Bolding 2026-10-01.
# The PM agent's working area: the local decision register and its
# companions, until the register moves to the Notion RAID Log through the
# PM agent. The folder's README is the one file that is shared.
pm/*
!pm/README.md
# Scope Tracker snapshots carry fees and billing terms. The live tracker is
# in Google Drive.
project/scope-tracker/
# Superseded documents. The folder's README is shared.
archive/*
!archive/README.md
# Drafts awaiting review and third-party AI output.
CLAUDE.proposed.md
migration/cis-contact-center-history-2026-09-30.md
migration/reference/

